# Reviewed, immutable metadata definitions copied from Dropbox to the SOC.
# The task root is the metadata directory; only strict, top-level versioned
# CSV exports are eligible. Stable and development filenames remain separate.
- **/*.partial
- **/*.partial.*
- **/*.tmp
- **/.*/**
+ /{{suncet_metadata_definition_v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+-FITS\.csv}}
+ /{{suncet_metadata_definition_v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+dev-FITS\.csv}}
+ /{{suncet_metadata_definition_v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+-NetCDF-Zarr\.csv}}
+ /{{suncet_metadata_definition_v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+dev-NetCDF-Zarr\.csv}}
- /**
